  "question": "Let \\(f(x)=(\\tan x)^{3/2}-3\\tan x+\\sqrt{\\tan x}\\). Consider the three integrals \\(I_1=\\int_0^1f(x)\\,dx,\\ I_2=\\int_{0.3}^{1.3}f(x)\\,dx,\\ I_3=\\int_{0.5}^{1.5}f(x)\\,dx\\). Then,",
